    "prefix": "acsum",
    "description": "累積和・二次元累積和 | 更新には不向き。二次元は長方形のリストを渡す。負数も扱える。",
    "body": [
      "# Source: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/library/prefix_sum.py",
      "# Provenance: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/PROVENANCE.md",
      "# AI生成: OpenAI Codex（2026-10-12）。出典の確認範囲は PROVENANCE.md を参照。",
      "# 累積和・二次元累積和",
      "# 条件: 更新には不向き。二次元は長方形のリストを渡す。負数も扱える。",
      "# 計算量: 一次元: 構築O(N)、問合せO(1)、空間O(N)。二次元: 構築・空間O(HW)、問合せO(1)。",
      "# API: prefix_sum(a)、range_sum(p,l,r)、prefix_sum_2d(grid)、rect_sum(p,top,left,bottom,right)。",
      "# 添字は原則0始まり、区間は [l, r)。末尾は単独実行用の例。",
      "def prefix_sum(a):",
      "    p = [0]",
      "    for x in a:",
      "        p.append(p[-1] + x)",
      "    return p",
      "",
      "def range_sum(p, l, r):",
      "    return p[r] - p[l]",
      "",
      "def prefix_sum_2d(grid):",
      "    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0]) if grid else 0",
      "    p = [[0] * (w + 1) for _ in range(h + 1)]",
      "    for i in range(h):",
      "        for j in range(w):",
      "            p[i+1][j+1] = grid[i][j] + p[i][j+1] + p[i+1][j] - p[i][j]",
      "    return p",
      "",
      "def rect_sum(p, top, left, bottom, right):",
      "    return p[bottom][right] - p[top][right] - p[bottom][left] + p[top][left]",
      "",
      "$0"
    ]
  },
