  "number_theory": {
    "scope": "python",
    "prefix": "acnum",
    "description": "GCD・約数列挙・素数のふるい | divisorsはn>=1。sieveはn>=0。0の約数列挙は定義しない。",
    "body": [
      "# Source: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/library/number_theory.py",
      "# Provenance: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/PROVENANCE.md",
      "# AI生成: OpenAI Codex（2026-10-12）。出典の確認範囲は PROVENANCE.md を参照。",
      "# GCD・約数列挙・素数のふるい",
      "# 条件: divisorsはn>=1。sieveはn>=0。0の約数列挙は定義しない。",
      "# 計算量: gcd: O(log min(a,b))。約数: O(sqrt(n)+D log D)時間・O(D)空間。ふるい: O(N log log N)時間・O(N)空間。",
      "# API: gcd(a,b)、lcm(a,b)、divisors(n)、sieve(n) -> n以下の素数リスト。",
      "# 添字は原則0始まり、区間は [l, r)。末尾は単独実行用の例。",
      "from math import gcd, lcm, isqrt",
      "",
      "def divisors(n):",
      "    if n < 1:",
      "        raise ValueError('n >= 1 が必要')",
      "    result = []",
      "    for d in range(1, isqrt(n) + 1):",
      "        if n % d == 0:",
      "            result.append(d)",
      "            if d * d != n:",
      "                result.append(n // d)",
      "    return sorted(result)",
      "",
      "def sieve(n):",
      "    prime = [True] * (n + 1)",
      "    if n >= 0:",
      "        prime[0] = False",
      "    if n >= 1:",
      "        prime[1] = False",
      "    for p in range(2, isqrt(n) + 1):",
      "        if prime[p]:",
      "            for x in range(p * p, n + 1, p):",
      "                prime[x] = False",
      "    return [i for i, ok in enumerate(prime) if ok]",
      "",
      "$0"
    ]
  },
