    "description": "Fenwick Tree / BIT・転倒数 | 外部添字は0始まり、内部だけ1始まり。同値は転倒に数えない。",
    "body": [
      "# Source: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/library/fenwick_tree.py",
      "# Provenance: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/PROVENANCE.md",
      "# AI生成: OpenAI Codex（2026-10-12）。出典の確認範囲は PROVENANCE.md を参照。",
      "# Fenwick Tree / BIT・転倒数",
      "# 条件: 外部添字は0始まり、内部だけ1始まり。同値は転倒に数えない。",
      "# 計算量: 初期化O(N)、更新・和O(log N)、空間O(N)。転倒数O(N log(N+1))。",
      "# API: Fenwick(n).add(i,x)、prefix(r)、sum(l,r)。inversions(a)。",
      "# 添字は原則0始まり、区間は [l, r)。末尾は単独実行用の例。",
      "class Fenwick:",
      "    def __init__(self, n):",
      "        self.n, self.bit = n, [0] * (n + 1)",
      "",
      "    def add(self, i, x):",
      "        if not 0 <= i < self.n:",
      "            raise IndexError(i)",
      "        i += 1",
      "        while i <= self.n:",
      "            self.bit[i] += x",
      "            i += i & -i",
      "",
      "    def prefix(self, r):",
      "        result = 0",
      "        while r:",
      "            result += self.bit[r]",
      "            r -= r & -r",
      "        return result",
      "",
      "    def sum(self, l, r):",
      "        return self.prefix(r) - self.prefix(l)",
      "",
      "def inversions(a):",
      "    rank = {x: i for i, x in enumerate(sorted(set(a)))\\}",
      "    tree = Fenwick(len(rank))",
      "    result = 0",
      "    for i, x in enumerate(a):",
      "        r = rank[x]",
      "        result += i - tree.prefix(r + 1)",
      "        tree.add(r, 1)",
      "    return result",
      "",
      "$0"
    ]
