  "scc": {
    "scope": "python",
    "prefix": "acscc",
    "description": "強連結成分分解 / SCC | 成分番号は縮約DAGのトポロジカル順。異成分の辺v→uではid[v]<id[u]。無向の成分分解とは違う。",
    "body": [
      "# Source: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/library/scc.py",
      "# Provenance: https://github.com/kacchan-writer/atcoder-library/blob/72b5963edde2f2daad36c0ca5aaa6c54ae257d09/PROVENANCE.md",
      "# AI生成: OpenAI Codex（2026-10-12）。出典の確認範囲は PROVENANCE.md を参照。",
      "# 強連結成分分解 / SCC",
      "# 条件: 成分番号は縮約DAGのトポロジカル順。異成分の辺v→uではid[v]<id[u]。無向の成分分解とは違う。",
      "# 計算量: O(V+E)時間、O(V+E)空間。",
      "# API: scc(graph) -> (各頂点の成分番号, 成分ごとの頂点リスト)。",
      "# 添字は原則0始まり、区間は [l, r)。末尾は単独実行用の例。",
      "def scc(graph):",
      "    n = len(graph)",
      "    reverse = [[] for _ in range(n)]",
      "    for v, row in enumerate(graph):",
      "        for u in row:",
      "            reverse[u].append(v)",
      "    seen, order = [False] * n, []",
      "    for start in range(n):",
      "        if seen[start]:",
      "            continue",
      "        seen[start] = True",
      "        stack = [(start, 0)]",
      "        while stack:",
      "            v, i = stack[-1]",
      "            if i == len(graph[v]):",
      "                order.append(v)",
      "                stack.pop()",
      "            else:",
      "                stack[-1] = (v, i + 1)",
      "                u = graph[v][i]",
      "                if not seen[u]:",
      "                    seen[u] = True",
      "                    stack.append((u, 0))",
      "    ids, groups = [-1] * n, []",
      "    for start in reversed(order):",
      "        if ids[start] >= 0:",
      "            continue",
      "        group = []",
      "        ids[start] = len(groups)",
      "        stack = [start]",
      "        while stack:",
      "            v = stack.pop()",
      "            group.append(v)",
      "            for u in reverse[v]:",
      "                if ids[u] < 0:",
      "                    ids[u] = ids[start]",
      "                    stack.append(u)",
      "        groups.append(group)",
      "    return ids, groups",
      "",
      "$0"
    ]
  },
